'''Security Services''' was a business located at [[Orondia Refueling Station]]<ref name="Friends" /> and [[Stobar Spaceport]] during the [[Clone Wars]],<ref name="Brothers" /> and [[Havoc Outpost]]<ref name="Sisters" /> and [[Horizon Base]] during the [[Galactic Civil War]].<ref name="Forgotten" /> During the [[First Order-Resistance War]], an advertisement for the company was seen on the exterior of [[Vranki's Hotel and Casino]], a [[space station]] in the [[Voxx Cluster]].<ref name="Voxx">{{Resistance|The Voxx Vortex 5000}}</ref> The business featured a multi-[[color]]ed sign in dark gray, grayish-green and white, stating the business' name in [[Aurebesh]].<ref name="Sisters" />

